  "description": "Dependency-free reinforcement learning library for .NET 10. Gym-style environments, a SIMD neural-network engine, and prebuilt DQN, A2C, PPO, SAC and TD3 agents with multi-agent support. Dibuat oleh Gravicode Studios, dipimpin oleh Kang Fadhil.",
