  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "0.3.0: DQN, SAC and TD3 train across a VectorEnvironment (every neural agent is now batched; Catalog.CreateVectorAgent builds them). Generalised state-dependent exploration (gSDE) for continuous A2C, on by default in Catalog: same mean on Reacher with a quarter of the seed-to-seed spread. Fixes: deterministic action selection no longer draws from the training generator or inserts Q-table rows, and no longer overwrites Metrics.Epsilon; loading a checkpoint restores it. Behaviour change: a deterministic Q-learning agent breaks ties toward the lowest action index.",
